Otherwise, how could there be a turnaround?

275
00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:50.236
Oops, where is my laptop?

276
00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.499
Here it is

277
00:18:11.424 --> 00:18:12.842
(The Power of Jealousy Kim Soo-gyeom)

278
00:18:12.925 --> 00:18:13.843
"Kim Soo Kyum"?

279
00:18:18.545 --> 00:18:19.682
(Loan repayment notice)

280
00:18:19.765 --> 00:18:21.225
"Loan"?

281
00:18:23.019 --> 00:18:24.937
(Repayment details as of July 2025)

282
00:18:25.021 --> 00:18:26.188
(Total loan amount: 30 million won)

283
00:18:26.272 --> 00:18:29.191
I like it so much
This culture of drinking during the day is great.

284
00:18:30.222 --> 00:18:31.444
Not that serious

285
00:18:34.488 --> 00:18:35.823
Kim Soo Kyum?

286
00:18:37.783 --> 00:18:39.285
Do you all know about this?

287
00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.584
(Loan repayment notice)

288
00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:48.044
Is this number empty?

289
00:18:48.127 --> 00:18:49.045
try again

290
00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:50.755
I've called it a dozen times

291
00:18:50.838 --> 00:18:52.465
Hey, he's in Los Angeles now

292
00:18:53.007 --> 00:18:53.883
- What?
- What?

293
00:18:56.302 --> 00:18:58.721
Wait, this bastard took out a loan in our name.
And then ran away?

294
00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.181
Can't believe it

295
00:19:00.264 --> 00:19:01.849
I guess he even took away all the investment money.

296
00:19:02.683 --> 00:19:06.085
What a complete scumbag!

297
00:19:06.185 --> 00:19:07.235
Wait a minute

298
00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.435
How much money did he loan in our name?

299
00:19:11.567 --> 00:19:13.611
30 million won per person

300
00:19:13.694 --> 00:19:14.737
- Thirty million?
- Thirty million?

301
00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.946
Thirty million

302
00:19:19.909 --> 00:19:21.619
- I was planning to buy a new car
- Hey

303
00:19:21.702 --> 00:19:23.788
Let's get the money

304
00:19:23.871 --> 00:19:25.706
The above account will suffice, right?

305
00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.541
I promised my girlfriend that I would go to Ibiza

306
00:19:27.625 --> 00:19:28.751
The money was returned

307
00:19:28.834 --> 00:19:29.877
me too

308
00:19:31.003 --> 00:19:32.880
- I'm going to be extremely poor these days.
- Yeah

309
00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:36.967
Wait

310
00:19:37.927 --> 00:19:40.179
Have you all paid back the money?

311
00:19:40.262 --> 00:19:43.641
Yes, I feel so awkward
This matter must be resolved immediately

312
00:19:43.724 --> 00:19:45.142
What to do now?

313
00:19:45.226 --> 00:19:47.520
What else can we do? Take this opportunity to go back

314
00:19:48.145 --> 00:19:50.940
- We have to get ready to go back to school.
- Yeah, Korea is quite interesting.

315
00:19:51.023 --> 00:19:52.316
Quite fun

316
00:19:53.401 --> 00:19:54.819
Goodbye, never see you again

317
00:19:54.902 --> 00:19:55.945
Goodbye

318
00:19:56.821 --> 00:19:58.030
take care

319
00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:10.459
Aren't you leaving?

320
00:20:18.384 --> 00:20:19.969
Damn this bastard

321
00:20:20.845 --> 00:20:23.431
At least pay the electricity bill before running away?

322
00:20:27.893 --> 00:20:29.937
Lee Jung Hwan, you bastard!

323
00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:48.456
(Specialist Shen Kangxun)

324
00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:54.170
- The number you dialed...
- Damn it, shut down again

325
00:20:55.337 --> 00:20:57.506
he doesn't tell me anything

326
00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.300
How should I prepare?

327
00:21:01.385 --> 00:21:04.638
Damn, what a complete liar.

328
00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:07.641
He wolfed down the medicinal duck soup

329
00:21:08.142 --> 00:21:10.936
I should have known this after eating five large scallion pancakes

330
00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:14.774
I still believe him. What an idiot.

331
00:21:16.776 --> 00:21:17.818
Damn it

332
00:21:21.614 --> 00:21:22.531
Alas

333
00:21:22.615 --> 00:21:25.409
(Staff dormitory)

334
00:21:27.369 --> 00:21:28.829
Who is it?

335
00:21:34.752 --> 00:21:35.836
What are you doing here?

336
00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:36.837
Wife!

337
00:21:37.463 --> 00:21:39.673
I didn't even make a call. Why are you here?

338
00:21:39.757 --> 00:21:41.634
It's dangerous so late

339
00:21:42.843 --> 00:21:44.887
Let me give you a surprise

340
00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.889
You really surprised me

341
00:21:46.961 --> 00:21:48.140
Where did you get this car?

342
00:21:49.791 --> 00:21:50.667
I...

343
00:21:53.521 --> 00:21:54.886
Won the prize

344
00:21:55.889 --> 00:21:58.061
Please stop joking
Seriously, where did you get the car?

345
00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.653
Really, I'll go in and talk to you slowly.

346
00:22:01.529 --> 00:22:03.529
- Wait, I'm going to take out the trash first.
- OK

347
00:22:08.911 --> 00:22:11.981
Really? The car belongs to Ha Young?

348
00:22:12.081 --> 00:22:13.833
Of course

349
00:22:14.625 --> 00:22:16.707
Her brother-in-law bought her a new car

350
00:22:16.794 --> 00:22:19.922
Don't crash other people's cars. Drive carefully.

351
00:22:22.216 --> 00:22:23.133
Come

352
00:22:24.426 --> 00:22:26.428
Come in!

353
00:22:26.512 --> 00:22:30.307
Ouch, what are these? It’s so heavy.

354
00:22:30.801 --> 00:22:33.602
OK come on

355
00:22:34.478 --> 00:22:35.604
Take a look...

356
00:22:41.026 --> 00:22:43.445
- You haven't had dinner yet?
- Nope

357
00:22:43.529 --> 00:22:45.823
I'll cook hot pot for you

358
00:22:45.906 --> 00:22:47.074
OK

359
00:22:47.992 --> 00:22:49.118
put on top

360
00:22:49.201 --> 00:22:50.696
- In here?
- Right put the freezer layer

361
00:22:50.771 --> 00:22:51.704
good

362
00:22:52.746 --> 00:22:55.165
Is Sang Cheol's company open?

363
00:22:55.265 --> 00:22:56.458
Opened long ago

364
00:22:56.542 --> 00:22:59.336
We also hired people and held an opening ceremony.

365
00:22:59.879 --> 00:23:01.088
That's it

366
00:23:02.464 --> 00:23:04.300
Why do you ask?

367
00:23:05.134 --> 00:23:07.453
Nothing. Do you need my help?

368
00:23:08.219 --> 00:23:10.931
Oops, the sun is coming out in the west?

369
00:23:11.015 --> 00:23:13.851
Please, let me help
We can get it done quickly. What do you want me to do?

370
00:23:15.728 --> 00:23:19.177
You have been doing housework for several months. Do you understand?

371
00:23:19.273 --> 00:23:22.359
We really need to calculate housework on an hourly basis
That's no joke

372
00:23:22.443 --> 00:23:23.694
Yes you are right

373
00:23:27.114 --> 00:23:28.490
good

374
00:23:32.786 --> 00:23:33.954
- Wife
- Oh, you scared me.

375
00:23:34.038 --> 00:23:35.149
I almost cut my hand

376
00:23:35.655 --> 00:23:36.582
Wife

377
00:23:36.665 --> 00:23:38.459
Why are you doing this? Stop making trouble

378
00:23:38.542 --> 00:23:42.129
- Will you stay tonight?
- No, I have to go home.

379
00:23:42.212 --> 00:23:43.297
- Don't leave
- Don't do this

380
00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:44.506
- Don't leave
- Stop it

381
00:23:44.590 --> 00:23:46.085
- Are you crazy?
- Have another baby?

382
00:23:46.185 --> 00:23:47.176
Have another baby?

383
00:23:47.853 --> 00:23:49.386
- I want a daughter
- Oops

384
00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:50.879
- I really want a daughter
- Stop it

385
00:23:50.954 --> 00:23:52.154
Soo Gyeom is no longer cute

386
00:23:52.222 --> 00:23:53.640
- They don't even listen to me.
- Oh my God!

387
00:23:53.730 --> 00:23:55.309
- Seriously, stop it!
- What?

388
00:23:56.894 --> 00:23:58.437
Really

389
00:23:58.520 --> 00:23:59.605
Oops

390
00:24:07.029 --> 00:24:08.280
- Let's eat
- Let's eat

391
00:24:08.781 --> 00:24:10.824
You can tell by looking at it that it will be delicious.

392
00:24:11.367 --> 00:24:12.910
- Awesome
- Look!

393
00:24:12.993 --> 00:24:14.286
- wow
- OK

394
00:24:15.245 --> 00:24:17.289
have a drink

395
00:24:17.373 --> 00:24:18.290
thank you

396
00:24:18.374 --> 00:24:19.625
I want it too

397
00:24:20.334 --> 00:24:22.461
Pour you some

398
00:24:24.171 --> 00:24:25.631
- Come
- Cheers

399
00:24:25.714 --> 00:24:26.715
Cheers

400
00:24:27.443 --> 00:24:28.342
(The monthly salary will be cut off and the monthly rent will not be)

401
00:24:28.968 --> 00:24:30.094
What is that?

402
00:24:31.303 --> 00:24:32.221
What?

403
00:24:32.304 --> 00:24:33.430
that flyer

404
00:24:34.765 --> 00:24:35.683
Don't know

405
00:24:37.226 --> 00:24:39.603
You glued it together with tape and you still say you don’t know?

406
00:24:40.104 --> 00:24:42.398
I don't know. Why is this thing here?

407
00:24:42.481 --> 00:24:43.399
I don't know

408
00:24:44.566 --> 00:24:48.028
Ah, it’s been a long time since I had a home-cooked meal.
looks delicious

409
00:24:53.701 --> 00:24:55.869
How long do you have to stay here?

410
00:24:59.289 --> 00:25:01.959
Well, not everyone can do this position.

411
00:25:02.042 --> 00:25:04.837
Waiting for a suitable replacement to be found
I will go back naturally

412
00:25:06.171 --> 00:25:08.007
Then you can't go back to the headquarters

413
00:25:08.966 --> 00:25:10.801
I told you, this is executive coaching.

414
00:25:11.844 --> 00:25:12.720
You can't go back

415
00:25:12.803 --> 00:25:14.263
I told you that's not the case

416
00:25:14.346 --> 00:25:16.515
If you yell at me again, I will go home

417
00:25:19.560 --> 00:25:20.561
Oops

418
00:25:23.063 --> 00:25:26.108
Stop denying it and explain it to me.

419
00:25:26.692 --> 00:25:28.944
I have to find out what's going on, right?

420
00:25:52.801 --> 00:25:53.927
What are you going to do?

421
00:25:54.720 --> 00:25:55.763
What to do?

422
00:25:55.846 --> 00:25:59.308
Do you want to hold on or are you planning to resign?

423
00:25:59.850 --> 00:26:01.894
Maybe I'll go back

424
00:26:01.977 --> 00:26:03.187
ok

425
00:26:03.270 --> 00:26:06.148
But what if I can’t go back?

426
00:26:07.608 --> 00:26:08.484
Oh, it's true

427
00:26:11.779 --> 00:26:13.155
Don't resign out of anger

428
00:26:14.823 --> 00:26:17.534
I know it's a bit selfish to say that.
But please don't do that

429
00:26:18.035 --> 00:26:19.828
We need to plan for the next few years

430
00:26:20.579 --> 00:26:22.414
You also know about the loan

431
00:26:22.498 --> 00:26:25.751
Soo-gyeom is just a freshman
Even if he has a family, he can handle it by himself

432
00:26:27.211 --> 00:26:29.129
But we have to support him until he graduates.

433
00:26:30.380 --> 00:26:34.051
Don't waver just for the severance pay. Just hold on.

434
00:26:36.762 --> 00:26:37.638
I...

435
00:26:38.722 --> 00:26:41.767
I can help now too

436
00:26:43.602 --> 00:26:44.561
What does it mean?

437
00:26:48.440 --> 00:26:50.943
I didn't mean to tell you this

438
00:26:51.693 --> 00:26:52.986
What's wrong? Tell me

439
00:26:55.906 --> 00:26:58.450
I passed the real estate agent exam

440
00:26:59.576 --> 00:27:00.452
What?

441
00:27:00.536 --> 00:27:03.497
I secretly prepared for the exam without letting you know. I passed the exam.

442
00:27:05.999 --> 00:27:07.251
I really can't believe it

443
00:27:08.210 --> 00:27:09.670
What did you take me for?

444
00:27:10.337 --> 00:27:11.588
What else can I take you for?

445
00:27:11.672 --> 00:27:14.007
I don't think of you as a superhero

446
00:27:14.091 --> 00:27:15.634
Or "Hundred Battles with Heavenly Dragons"

447
00:27:16.552 --> 00:27:19.680
I just think of you as the Kim Nak Soo I know
and then make a decision

448
00:27:25.227 --> 00:27:26.270
I mean...

449
00:27:27.563 --> 00:27:30.983
Do you think making money is as easy as it sounds?

450
00:27:33.110 --> 00:27:34.653
Do you think I...

451
00:27:37.823 --> 00:27:40.742
No, I just...
I really don't want to see you like this

452
00:27:43.328 --> 00:27:44.413
Oops

453
00:27:47.541 --> 00:27:48.667
You go

454
00:28:45.015 --> 00:28:47.809
Did she really pass the real estate agent exam?

455
00:28:56.360 --> 00:28:57.486
What if I get fired...

456
00:29:00.030 --> 00:29:01.657
She is the only one working...

457
00:29:04.034 --> 00:29:05.202
What a wise choice

458
00:29:05.786 --> 00:29:07.287
Waiting for you to pay the deposit

459
00:29:07.371 --> 00:29:08.789
- We will help you immediately...
- Oops

460
00:29:08.872 --> 00:29:10.499
- ...Go through the signing procedures
- that's it

461
00:29:11.500 --> 00:29:12.834
Hello!

462
00:29:12.918 --> 00:29:13.961
What are you doing?

463
00:29:14.044 --> 00:29:15.337
Turn off!

464
00:29:17.547 --> 00:29:18.674
Yes

465
00:29:18.757 --> 00:29:20.175
Your ID card...

466
00:29:20.259 --> 00:29:22.678
Please don't do this. You make me uncomfortable.

467
00:29:22.761 --> 00:29:23.804
- Sang Cheol!
- let me go

468
00:29:23.887 --> 00:29:25.055
Sang Cheol!

469
00:29:34.106 --> 00:29:36.108
Deposit, down payment and installment payment

470
00:29:36.191 --> 00:29:37.859
Every transaction will not be stressful

471
00:29:47.536 --> 00:29:48.745
Who is that guy?

472
00:29:48.829 --> 00:29:51.707
We met at work. Leave me alone.

473
00:29:51.790 --> 00:29:53.375
Did they really meet at work?

474
00:29:53.458 --> 00:29:54.876
Really?

475
00:29:54.960 --> 00:29:55.836
Oh my god

476
00:29:56.837 --> 00:29:58.255
Don't go drinking with him

477
00:29:58.338 --> 00:29:59.965
Clean the house!

478
00:30:23.947 --> 00:30:24.906
Wife

479
00:30:28.535 --> 00:30:29.745
Wife

480
00:30:31.455 --> 00:30:32.372
Wife

481
00:30:44.217 --> 00:30:45.260
Wife...

482
00:30:45.344 --> 00:30:46.261
No!

483
00:30:52.434 --> 00:30:55.270
This is not okay!

484
00:31:02.235 --> 00:31:04.488
He just stopped for a while
Why did the commotion start again?

485
00:31:06.907 --> 00:31:08.116
Leave him alone

486
00:31:08.825 --> 00:31:10.577
Think about how uncomfortable he must be

487
00:31:18.752 --> 00:31:20.087
Kim Nak Soo!

488
00:31:20.587 --> 00:31:22.381
Who is he?

489
00:31:22.923 --> 00:31:24.925
I'm a minister

490
00:31:25.008 --> 00:31:27.761
I had a smooth journey
Never miss a promotion opportunity

491
00:31:27.844 --> 00:31:28.804
thank you

492
00:31:28.887 --> 00:31:31.640
I am a famous college student recruited through open recruitment
The best of the best

493
00:31:31.723 --> 00:31:34.643
I will be promoted to a senior executive next year, 99.9% no problem

494
00:31:34.726 --> 00:31:35.644
Do you know?

495
00:31:35.727 --> 00:31:38.146
Dog food bowls are attracting flies

496
00:31:38.230 --> 00:31:41.108
The poop bag is also full. Please take it out and throw it away.

497
00:31:50.325 --> 00:31:51.701
I bought an apartment in Seoul

498
00:31:52.202 --> 00:31:53.537
It's my own money!

499
00:31:54.162 --> 00:31:56.832
I sent my son to college!

500
00:31:57.374 --> 00:31:58.625
I worked in a big company

501
00:31:59.167 --> 00:32:00.585
25 years

502
00:32:01.169 --> 00:32:03.004
I'm still a minister!

503
00:32:03.505 --> 00:32:04.923
You bastards!

504
00:32:23.066 --> 00:32:24.276
Damn it!

505
00:32:31.450 --> 00:32:33.452
Why do you do this to me?

506
00:32:39.666 --> 00:32:41.042
What the hell is going on?

507
00:32:52.512 --> 00:32:55.932
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

508
00:33:00.937 --> 00:33:01.855
Kim Nak Soo

509
00:33:02.606 --> 00:33:03.815
Yes, Executive Bai

510
00:33:03.899 --> 00:33:06.568
Why is it so noisy over there?
Can you hear me?

511
00:33:06.651 --> 00:33:08.820
Yes can hear

512
00:33:09.488 --> 00:33:12.157
You often scold me behind my back, right?

513
00:33:12.741 --> 00:33:14.493
No, of course not

514
00:33:16.453 --> 00:33:18.121
Stop pretending, kid

515
00:33:19.789 --> 00:33:21.124
Have you eaten?

516
00:33:33.678 --> 00:33:36.848
four, five, six, seven, eight

517
00:33:36.932 --> 00:33:39.518
two, two, three, four

518
00:33:39.601 --> 00:33:42.270
five, six, seven, eight

519
00:33:42.354 --> 00:33:45.023
two, two, three, four

520
00:33:46.608 --> 00:33:47.484
five

521
00:33:55.492 --> 00:33:57.202
- How about this? Can you see it?
- visible

522
00:33:57.994 --> 00:33:59.788
- Okay, let's shoot
- Yes

523
00:34:01.706 --> 00:34:02.582
three

524
00:34:03.875 --> 00:34:05.544
one, two, three

525
00:34:19.933 --> 00:34:20.850
Oops

526
00:34:24.479 --> 00:34:27.023
I have to go to the headquarters later

527
00:34:28.608 --> 00:34:30.068
I didn't ask you

528
00:34:31.444 --> 00:34:33.947
Not only do safety management but also reporting to the headquarters...

529
00:34:35.031 --> 00:34:37.909
I'm so busy Oops

530
00:34:37.993 --> 00:34:40.607
{\an8}(reception desk payment desk)

531
00:34:48.709 --> 00:34:51.381
(Five safety rules
Safety Operation Logistics Inspection)

532
00:34:53.300 --> 00:34:54.515
(Safety Checklist Factory Safety Inspection)

533
00:34:54.634 --> 00:34:55.574
(Benefits of safe exercise)

534
00:35:10.942 --> 00:35:13.236
Hey hyung, it’s me Kim Nak-soo

535
00:35:14.571 --> 00:35:17.157
Are we going to have dinner together tonight?

536
00:35:17.240 --> 00:35:21.411
Yeah, I've sent you the address.
What's wrong? What happened?

537
00:35:21.494 --> 00:35:24.247
No, I just called to confirm.

538
00:35:24.331 --> 00:35:26.833
- Okay, see you then.
- Oh, one more thing.

539
00:35:27.375 --> 00:35:29.836
Is this the logistics team or the production team?

540
00:35:29.919 --> 00:35:32.464
Want me to prepare some training materials

541
00:35:32.964 --> 00:35:35.842
I'll send it to you later
Can you give me some feedback?

542
00:35:35.925 --> 00:35:39.054
I feel a little rusty lately

543
00:35:39.137 --> 00:35:40.430
Not sure how prepared it is

544
00:35:40.513 --> 00:35:43.767
I don't understand this at all
Does my opinion matter?

545
00:35:43.850 --> 00:35:46.603
It's okay. Can you scan it quickly?

546
00:35:46.686 --> 00:35:48.021
I'll send it to you shortly

547
00:35:48.104 --> 00:35:49.731
ok ok

548
00:35:49.814 --> 00:35:52.859
See you later. Thank you.

549
00:36:01.117 --> 00:36:02.661
You can do it Kim Nak-soo

550
00:36:06.623 --> 00:36:08.750
Does anyone have plans for tonight?

551
00:36:12.337 --> 00:36:14.255
It's okay, just say it

552
00:36:14.881 --> 00:36:15.882
we have no arrangements

553
00:36:15.965 --> 00:36:17.967
We're fine too

554
00:36:18.677 --> 00:36:21.554
How about having a dinner with the sales team tonight?

555
00:36:22.222 --> 00:36:24.057
- OK! Team dinner!
- Awesome

556
00:36:24.140 --> 00:36:25.058
OK

557
00:36:25.141 --> 00:36:27.185
Would you like to book your favorite craft beer house?

558
00:36:27.268 --> 00:36:29.145
It's really nice there, but Songxi

559
00:36:29.813 --> 00:36:30.897
Is it Minister?

560
00:36:30.980 --> 00:36:34.234
Go to the restaurant your group usually goes to. I want to try it.

561
00:36:35.860 --> 00:36:36.820
Good

562
00:36:36.903 --> 00:36:39.030
After I meet the client, I'll go over there and meet you.

563
00:36:39.114 --> 00:36:40.073
Send me the address

564
00:36:40.156 --> 00:36:41.783
- Good Minister
- See you at the restaurant

565
00:36:41.866 --> 00:36:43.910
- Okay. See you later.
- See you soon, Minister.

566
00:36:43.993 --> 00:36:45.745
- See you later
- Be careful on the road

567
00:37:07.934 --> 00:37:09.269
What are you doing?

568
00:37:12.772 --> 00:37:16.860
I have to sell this and pay back the interest first.

569
00:37:19.904 --> 00:37:21.239
(Coffee machine for sale, please contact us)

570
00:37:21.322 --> 00:37:22.991
Hey what is this?

571
00:37:23.074 --> 00:37:24.868
Do you want to buy it when you see it?

572
00:37:24.951 --> 00:37:28.079
What if? What should I do?

573
00:37:30.957 --> 00:37:31.875
Are you selling this?

574
00:37:31.958 --> 00:37:32.834
Yes

575
00:37:46.556 --> 00:37:48.702
(Edit second-hand product post)

576
00:37:48.777 --> 00:37:50.518
(Less than one year old, includes two packs of coffee beans)

577
00:37:53.313 --> 00:37:55.190
How did you come up with these words so easily?

578
00:37:55.732 --> 00:37:58.026
I'm just listing the facts.

579
00:37:59.778 --> 00:38:03.615
The more useless details there are, the less credible it becomes.

580
00:38:08.661 --> 00:38:10.455
Is there anything else for sale?

581
00:38:11.664 --> 00:38:13.500
"Professional high-end audio"

582
00:38:14.167 --> 00:38:16.169
turntables and bluetooth devices

583
00:38:16.252 --> 00:38:19.714
"Medieval simplicity..."

584
00:38:20.340 --> 00:38:23.051
"Medieval style"? What is it?

585
00:38:24.636 --> 00:38:26.137
Medieval retro style

586
00:38:29.849 --> 00:38:32.936
If you take it with the desk, I'll give you 300,000

587
00:38:33.978 --> 00:38:35.355
- 250,000, right?
- 280,000

588
00:38:36.105 --> 00:38:37.732
- 260,000
- 280,000

589
00:38:37.816 --> 00:38:38.817
Okay 270,000!

590
00:38:41.528 --> 00:38:43.363
275,000?

591
00:38:44.697 --> 00:38:45.949
No more

592
00:38:48.785 --> 00:38:49.828
Great. We made money!

593
00:38:49.911 --> 00:38:50.954
(Oson Market)

594
00:38:51.037 --> 00:38:52.580
You can also send it to a convenience store

595
00:38:52.664 --> 00:38:53.748
I will wrap it up

596
00:38:54.624 --> 00:38:55.583
Good

597
00:38:57.418 --> 00:38:59.128
- Okay, let's go to the convenience store.
- let's go

598
00:39:08.638 --> 00:39:10.223
thank you

599
00:39:10.306 --> 00:39:11.933
- take care
- thank you

600
00:39:13.142 --> 00:39:16.563
(The power of jealousy)

601
00:39:16.646 --> 00:39:18.147
Ah I'm so hungry

602
00:39:18.648 --> 00:39:19.858
Aren't you hungry?

603
00:39:19.941 --> 00:39:21.442
I'm hungry too

604
00:39:21.526 --> 00:39:22.527
Let's go

605
00:39:25.405 --> 00:39:26.614
I want a bacon lettuce and tomato sandwich

606
00:39:26.698 --> 00:39:27.574
Good

607
00:39:27.657 --> 00:39:29.367
Let’s get started!

608
00:39:33.037 --> 00:39:34.747
As the saying goes: “If you don’t work, don’t eat.”

609
00:39:34.831 --> 00:39:37.750
It must mean that the food tastes better after work.

610
00:39:37.834 --> 00:39:40.003
This bagel is so delicious

611
00:39:40.086 --> 00:39:41.921
Do you want to order another one to share?

612
00:39:42.672 --> 00:39:45.174
Let's have one more person

613
00:39:45.258 --> 00:39:46.843
We made 3.8 million won today

614
00:39:46.926 --> 00:39:48.761
- Yeah, please order more.
- Order it

615
00:39:51.055 --> 00:39:52.307
We work well together, right?

616
00:39:57.270 --> 00:39:59.022
Hannah, since the momentum is good

617
00:39:59.105 --> 00:40:02.984
Why don't we buy some goods?
Seriously, start selling, right?

618
00:40:03.067 --> 00:40:04.736
How much money can be spent to purchase goods?

619
00:40:05.528 --> 00:40:07.030
I already owe 30 million won

620
00:40:09.490 --> 00:40:10.909
I'm going to find investors

621
00:40:18.416 --> 00:40:19.292
put on coat

622
00:40:27.008 --> 00:40:28.343
Let's go

623
00:40:39.187 --> 00:40:40.146
good

624
00:40:49.489 --> 00:40:50.573
Hurry up

625
00:40:57.622 --> 00:40:58.706
Very good

626
00:41:28.778 --> 00:41:31.197
It's been a long time since we said goodbye. Have you always been in good health?

627
00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:33.866
Kim Nak-soo, the incompetent villain, would like to say hello to you.

628
00:41:36.911 --> 00:41:39.372
What are you doing? Come on in

629
00:41:42.458 --> 00:41:44.293
This is a hangover cure, brother

630
00:41:44.377 --> 00:41:45.503
Oh my god

631
00:41:45.586 --> 00:41:47.755
There is also an interdental brush for use after meals.

632
00:41:47.839 --> 00:41:49.048
thank you

633
00:41:50.842 --> 00:41:51.801
Come

634
00:41:54.387 --> 00:41:55.471
Oh thank you

635
00:42:00.893 --> 00:42:02.061
- thank you
- Please use it slowly

636
00:42:02.145 --> 00:42:03.271
OK thank you

637
00:42:04.856 --> 00:42:07.400
Come and try the radish sprouts

638
00:42:09.444 --> 00:42:10.695
Please enjoy

639
00:42:11.863 --> 00:42:12.905
Do you want a treat?

640
00:42:13.614 --> 00:42:14.991
thank you for your treat

641
00:42:16.743 --> 00:42:19.162
- Let's get started
- OK

642
00:42:21.080 --> 00:42:21.956
Brother

643
00:42:23.583 --> 00:42:26.711
I learned a lot in the factory during this time

644
00:42:26.794 --> 00:42:29.797
I feel like all my time in the company was wasted.

645
00:42:29.881 --> 00:42:33.009
I didn’t communicate well with the team members either.

646
00:42:33.760 --> 00:42:36.554
Actually, I really appreciate you sending me to the factory

647
00:42:36.637 --> 00:42:39.932
If I hadn't gone to the factory
I may never understand in my life

648
00:42:40.475 --> 00:42:41.350
thank you

649
00:42:44.228 --> 00:42:45.688
- Then I'll feel relieved
- Yeah

650
00:42:48.441 --> 00:42:51.194
Wait, I'll pour it

651
00:42:51.694 --> 00:42:52.737
Come

652
00:42:53.905 --> 00:42:55.531
- I'll pour you a drink
- OK

653
00:42:58.868 --> 00:42:59.744
thank you

654
00:43:03.831 --> 00:43:04.874
It's been a long time since I've been like this...

655
00:43:04.957 --> 00:43:06.209
Oops

656
00:43:12.256 --> 00:43:13.758
- Team leader!
- Here!

657
00:43:14.258 --> 00:43:15.259
thank you

658
00:43:16.052 --> 00:43:19.138
Said it was a dinner party tonight
But I’m not asking everyone to come back until they get drunk.

659
00:43:19.222 --> 00:43:21.015
We'll just eat for an hour and then go home.

660
00:43:21.099 --> 00:43:22.183
- OK
- Yes

661
00:43:22.266 --> 00:43:23.309
Let's get started

662
00:43:23.392 --> 00:43:24.894
- Please enjoy
- Enjoy

663
00:43:24.977 --> 00:43:25.937
Please enjoy, team leader

664
00:43:26.437 --> 00:43:30.108
It’s really like a team dinner in an old Korean drama

665
00:43:30.191 --> 00:43:31.067
Really?

666
00:43:31.150 --> 00:43:33.402
After all, Minister Kim Nak-soo is an old-school person.

667
00:43:33.486 --> 00:43:34.612
This style suits him very well

668
00:43:34.695 --> 00:43:37.156
Well, he is much older than the capital minister...

669
00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:38.491
Hey, finished drinking

670
00:43:39.242 --> 00:43:40.701
Where is the wine?

671
00:43:42.036 --> 00:43:44.205
I'll get it

672
00:43:46.707 --> 00:43:49.127
I've had Xinqi soup here several times at noon

673
00:43:49.210 --> 00:43:50.503
But the taste is different at night

674
00:43:50.586 --> 00:43:51.504
Yes

675
00:43:52.213 --> 00:43:55.091
The soup base they use for lunch and evening is different

676
00:43:55.174 --> 00:43:57.760
Use rice water at noon and replace it with broth at night

677
00:43:57.844 --> 00:43:59.929
The boss said the soup for lunch was too greasy.

678
00:44:00.012 --> 00:44:01.597
It is easy to have indigestion when working in the afternoon

679
00:44:01.681 --> 00:44:03.224
So, the soup base changes back and forth.

680
00:44:03.307 --> 00:44:05.059
Wow, Minister, you are so awesome.

681
00:44:05.143 --> 00:44:06.394
The same goes for you, Agent Zheng

682
00:44:07.270 --> 00:44:08.146
What?

683
00:44:08.229 --> 00:44:10.064
I mean you're flexible.

684
00:44:10.148 --> 00:44:11.607
Both you and your boss are flexible.

685
00:44:13.943 --> 00:44:15.611
Yeah, I'm quite flexible.

686
00:44:17.697 --> 00:44:18.823
bottle opener

687
00:44:18.906 --> 00:44:19.866
- Bottle opener?
- Right

688
00:44:20.783 --> 00:44:22.243
Didn't you bring it with you?

689
00:44:24.245 --> 00:44:25.913
- sorry
- It's okay. I'll get it.

690
00:44:25.997 --> 00:44:27.915
Are you going? Just inside

691
00:44:28.708 --> 00:44:30.543
By the way, is the minister okay?

692
00:44:31.878 --> 00:44:32.962
Which minister are you talking about?

693
00:44:33.045 --> 00:44:34.172
Minister Kim Nak-soo

694
00:44:34.964 --> 00:44:36.632
Didn’t you go to the Asan Factory a while ago?

695
00:44:36.716 --> 00:44:37.758
Yes

696
00:44:37.842 --> 00:44:41.971
I lost the guessing game and had to go!

697
00:44:42.054 --> 00:44:44.390
You must have lost on purpose. You value friendship so much.

698
00:44:44.473 --> 00:44:47.143
No, it's not like that, Minister.

699
00:44:47.226 --> 00:44:48.936
Is that why he called us here?

700
00:44:49.020 --> 00:44:49.937
That's right

701
00:44:50.021 --> 00:44:52.356
And I'm on a business trip, so I have to run around.

702
00:44:52.440 --> 00:44:55.193
I didn’t even have time to smoke a cigarette with Minister Kim.

703
00:44:55.276 --> 00:44:56.736
But you still have to take good care of him

704
00:44:56.819 --> 00:44:58.487
I might have to work under him someday.

705
00:45:00.281 --> 00:45:01.866
It's unlikely that this will happen.

706
00:45:01.949 --> 00:45:04.660
Who knows? Things are unpredictable.

707
00:45:05.870 --> 00:45:08.706
If senior comes back
I will definitely welcome you with both hands

708
00:45:09.248 --> 00:45:10.708
I still have a lot to learn

709
00:45:12.376 --> 00:45:14.253
Come on, pour the wine and let's have a drink.

710
00:45:14.337 --> 00:45:15.213
OK

711
00:45:15.296 --> 00:45:17.673
- Everybody pour the wine
- OK

712
00:45:18.216 --> 00:45:19.425
I'll do it, team leader

713
00:45:20.092 --> 00:45:23.304
How can we have such excellent team members?
I'm such a lucky team leader

714
00:45:23.804 --> 00:45:24.764
Come to the sales team!

715
00:45:24.847 --> 00:45:26.015
- Come on!
- Come on!

716
00:45:27.350 --> 00:45:28.601
- Come on
- Come on

717
00:45:30.311 --> 00:45:31.187
Oops

718
00:45:32.104 --> 00:45:32.980
What else?

719
00:45:33.940 --> 00:45:34.815
Oops

720
00:45:36.275 --> 00:45:38.569
Oops, I'm so full. I can't eat anymore.

721
00:45:39.362 --> 00:45:42.031
If you have your favorite shrimp, I’m sure you can have some more

722
00:45:48.621 --> 00:45:52.291
Brother, did you read what I sent you?

723
00:45:52.375 --> 00:45:53.292
Yeah

724
00:45:54.168 --> 00:45:55.044
I watched

725
00:45:55.127 --> 00:45:59.006
That's what I got out of temporarily
What do you think?

726
00:45:59.757 --> 00:46:00.633
Not bad

727
00:46:01.384 --> 00:46:02.843
Since you were a newcomer

728
00:46:02.927 --> 00:46:04.845
The documentation is beautifully done

729
00:46:04.929 --> 00:46:06.430
Where where...

730
00:46:06.514 --> 00:46:08.224
I'm not here to hear praise

731
00:46:08.849 --> 00:46:10.977
If there is anything that needs improvement, please give me some advice.

732
00:46:15.690 --> 00:46:16.565
Are you serious?

733
00:46:18.234 --> 00:46:19.485
Of course

734
00:46:22.571 --> 00:46:26.617
What did you want to tell me when you made that report?

735
00:46:28.160 --> 00:46:29.036
What?

736
00:46:29.120 --> 00:46:30.830
That report was written specifically for me to read.

737
00:46:31.664 --> 00:46:32.623
Isn't it?

738
00:46:34.667 --> 00:46:36.585
I told you

739
00:46:36.669 --> 00:46:38.587
That's for internal factory training.

740
00:46:38.671 --> 00:46:42.466
It’s about the positive impact of stability on productivity...

741
00:46:43.175 --> 00:46:45.886
Okay. Then what?

742
00:46:46.762 --> 00:46:48.639
What do you suggest we do?

743
00:46:50.975 --> 00:46:53.644
Creating a more equal organizational culture...

744
00:46:53.728 --> 00:46:56.188
Create an equal organizational culture

745
00:46:56.689 --> 00:46:58.024
Is that your duty at the factory?

746
00:47:01.777 --> 00:47:06.073
To be honest, I really don't understand
What did you want to do with that report?

747
00:47:06.615 --> 00:47:09.118
Or want to express something

748
00:47:09.201 --> 00:47:10.911
no clue

749
00:47:11.579 --> 00:47:14.749
Although the report is neat and beautiful
but no substance

750
00:47:14.832 --> 00:47:15.833
Well...

751
00:47:17.001 --> 00:47:18.544
I still have a lot to learn, bro.

752
00:47:18.627 --> 00:47:20.546
I'll remember it. Sorry.

753
00:47:22.256 --> 00:47:23.215
Luo Zhu

754
00:47:23.299 --> 00:47:24.216
Huh?

755
00:47:24.884 --> 00:47:26.510
I think that report

756
00:47:27.094 --> 00:47:29.472
It explains your problem very well.

757
00:47:31.474 --> 00:47:32.725
you guy

758
00:47:34.602 --> 00:47:36.729
you are not working

759
00:47:43.694 --> 00:47:46.322
if i wasn't at work

760
00:47:47.073 --> 00:47:48.574
So what am I doing?

761
00:47:48.657 --> 00:47:50.451
You're pretending to be working

762
00:47:51.911 --> 00:47:53.496
Work is about responsibility

763
00:47:54.163 --> 00:47:56.582
But you took no responsibility

764
00:47:57.166 --> 00:48:00.294
No, you don't even know how to take responsibility

765
00:48:02.671 --> 00:48:04.924
I was transferred to the factory

766
00:48:05.007 --> 00:48:06.717
Are you saying you won't take responsibility?

767
00:48:10.304 --> 00:48:13.808
You really haven't changed at all

768
00:48:14.809 --> 00:48:19.188
You were indeed a good team member before

769
00:48:20.064 --> 00:48:21.107
But after all

770
00:48:21.899 --> 00:48:24.527
Failure to be a good leader

771
00:48:37.248 --> 00:48:38.749
- Luo Su
- Wait a minute, bro.

772
00:48:40.334 --> 00:48:43.587
You asked me to come all the way today
Just to say this?

773
00:48:43.671 --> 00:48:47.800
I said it out of concern for you.
I'm worried about you

774
00:48:47.883 --> 00:48:49.760
Is it because you care about me and worry about me?

775
00:48:52.221 --> 00:48:56.100
Okay, anyway, I came to you today because...

776
00:48:56.183 --> 00:48:57.184
No

777
00:48:58.310 --> 00:49:00.187
Do you have the right to worry about me?

778
00:49:00.271 --> 00:49:01.439
What?

779
00:49:01.522 --> 00:49:03.983
It was you who pushed me into the pit of fire

780
00:49:04.066 --> 00:49:07.486
I mean, how could the perpetrator worry about the victim?

781
00:49:07.570 --> 00:49:08.988
Kim Nak Soo, you are really...

782
00:49:09.071 --> 00:49:09.947
I'm not working?

783
00:49:10.030 --> 00:49:12.533
So what have I been doing for the past 25 years?

784
00:49:12.616 --> 00:49:14.493
You really don't understand, right?

785
00:49:14.577 --> 00:49:16.370
Yes, I don’t understand

786
00:49:16.454 --> 00:49:19.123
So I'm over 50 years old and I'm still shoveling dog poop in the factory.

787
00:49:19.206 --> 00:49:21.417
You're perfect for that job, brat.

788
00:49:21.500 --> 00:49:23.836
Am I pretending to be at work?

789
00:49:24.336 --> 00:49:27.381
So what does it mean to wash your underwear and socks?

790
00:49:27.465 --> 00:49:28.674
It's not even work, right?

791
00:49:28.757 --> 00:49:29.925
What are you talking about?

792
00:49:30.009 --> 00:49:32.344
If we let the team members do this kind of thing now,
Just wait for the lawsuit

793
00:49:32.428 --> 00:49:34.096
When did I ask you to wash your underwear?

794
00:49:34.180 --> 00:49:36.182
Then go sue me!

795
00:49:36.265 --> 00:49:38.309
You've never worked with young people, but I have

796
00:49:38.976 --> 00:49:41.437
I'm between you and them

797
00:49:41.520 --> 00:49:43.397
Please please both sides

798
00:49:44.064 --> 00:49:46.984
That’s why I brought you to where you are today!
What do you say to me now?

799
00:49:47.067 --> 00:49:48.861
What about you?

800
00:49:49.361 --> 00:49:51.113
Who do you think helped you keep your job?

801
00:49:51.197 --> 00:49:52.364
Are you saying it's all thanks to you?

802
00:49:52.448 --> 00:49:53.407
Of course it's me, idiot!

803
00:49:53.491 --> 00:49:55.701
You should have been fired!

804
00:49:55.784 --> 00:49:58.037
I risked my life to save you!

805
00:49:58.746 --> 00:50:01.415
That’s why you were just transferred to Asan! Do you understand?

806
00:50:15.095 --> 00:50:16.222
You boy

807
00:50:17.640 --> 00:50:19.808
I don't know

808
00:50:21.185 --> 00:50:22.603
I really don't know at all

809
00:50:24.104 --> 00:50:27.316
I thought it was because Du Zhenyu was more useful than me.

810
00:50:27.399 --> 00:50:30.361
I know your shady things

811
00:50:30.444 --> 00:50:33.072
That's why you feel like I'm an eyesore around you

812
00:50:33.155 --> 00:50:35.950
I thought you were taking this opportunity to get rid of me

813
00:50:36.033 --> 00:50:37.910
It turns out there is such a deep intention.

814
00:50:39.453 --> 00:50:41.830
It’s amazing Bai Zhengtai

815
00:50:42.998 --> 00:50:44.291
You bastard

816
00:50:44.375 --> 00:50:45.918
